# Agent Homebase

Before coding in `bakery/`, run `php scripts/agent_homebase.php brief --agent=<mission> --json` and follow `.cursor/skills/agent-homebase/SKILL.md`.

During work, pin decisions (`--column=decided` for lasting ones) and log durable bugs. Do not leave those only in chat.

End every session with a §10 handoff via `php scripts/agent_homebase.php handoff`. Completing exception *work* never hides a still-true operational fact. Local DB only; do not deploy; do not enable auto-push.
